sequenceDiagram
    participant Payment as Future Phase 9 Payment Engine
    participant Port as BookingPaymentPort
    participant Booking as Booking Engine
    participant Reservation as Phase 7 Reservation Engine
    Payment->>Port: getPaymentStartContext(bookingId)
    Port-->>Payment: Reference, amount, currency, deadline
    Payment->>Payment: Verify provider outcome outside booking transaction
    alt Verified success before safe expiry
        Payment->>Port: acceptVerifiedSuccess(amount, currency, event key)
        Port->>Booking: Validate transition and idempotency
        Booking->>Reservation: Confirm using matching booking ID
    else Definitive failure
        Payment->>Port: acceptVerifiedFailure(event key)
        Port->>Reservation: Release through controlled workflow
    else Pending or uncertain
        Payment->>Port: recordPendingOutcome or reconcileUncertainOutcome
        Port-->>Payment: Preserve state; do not infer failure
    end
